    "title": "Bristol aims to become UK’s first ‘wetland city’ and reduce flood risk",
    "summary": "A charity plans a five-year project to turn Bristol into the UK's first \"wetland city\". It will build wetlands that form wildlife corridors, lower flood risk and give residents more access to green and blue space.",
